      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Computer-assisted classification of hemodynamic data was performed in 172 patients with coronary heart disease aggravated by chronic heart failure. Six groups of patients have been identified, and an individual treatment algorithm has been proposed for each of those. The use of optimum individual treatment schedules has produced good or satisfactory clinical effect in 87.3%."},
